/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 500 0 R
/E (PROPOSED SYSTEM: Our project aims to streamline and modernize the current manual processes of DNJ Fruit Merchant and Commission Agent through the implementation of a Fruit Inventory Management System. This system will leverage technology to automate various tasks and improve overall efficiency. Our proposed system is simple and without complexity at the same time SQL server provides the features such as primary key, foreign key. Visual Basic is used as a Front end which will provide a strong graphic user interface along with a user-friendly environment.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
